"By providing your IBAN and confirming this form, you are authorizing %s and "
"Stripe, our payment service provider, to send instructions to your bank to "
"debit your account and your bank to debit your account in accordance with "
"those instructions. You are entitled to a refund from your bank under the "
"terms and conditions of your agreement with it. A refund must be claimed "
"within 8 weeks starting from the date on which your account was debited."
msgstr ""
"Door uw IBAN te verstrekken en dit formulier te bevestigen, machtigt u %s en "
"Stripe, onze betalingsdienstaanbieder, om instructies naar uw bank te sturen "
"om uw rekening en uw bank te debiteren om uw rekening te debiteren in "
"overeenstemming met deze instructies. U heeft recht op restitutie van uw "
"bank onder de voorwaarden van uw overeenkomst met uw bank. Een restitutie "
"moet worden geclaimd binnen 8 weken vanaf de datum waarop uw rekening is "
"gedebiteerd."

